  _senarioDescription: You start slowly approaching the stairs one step at a time.
    Upon reaching the edge of the stairs. *Creak* A noise from behind sends a shiver
    down your spine. You slowly look behind you being met with the creature towering
    over you and slowly unhinging its jaw to reveal its mouth that looks like a portal
    to another dimension, framed by razor-sharp teeth. In one quick motion, this
    creature swallows you whole. \nNot even the bones - Ending
